`Dieu 120(1) — the other unusual items: suspension, revocation or suspension of licence; division, merger, dissolution, change of type, investing abroad, opening or closing branches; ending of a foreign branch; accounting policy changes and audit opinions; penalties; court judgments and bankruptcy proceedings; prosecution; events seriously affecting participants; material information on capital, solvency, risk and governance; portfolio transfers; others (a list; the two numeric items are encoded above)` MEANS
    "A list of events."

