@ref Dieu 121 (src:2632-2637)
`Dieu 121 — responsibility for loss prevention and limitation and for anti-fraud is shared by the insurer, policyholder, insured person and the others concerned (statement; no rule evaluated)` MEANS
    "Shared responsibility."

